   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I'm working on an update which will come out in a few days!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It doesn't have any new content, but it fixes a lot of things that many players struggled with.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I also fixed some levels that makes them more fun and less tedious.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And a lot of performance optimizations, so if the game used to lag for you, hopefully it'll be better now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you own the game, the patch is now live on the beta branch, which you can check out yourself if you want.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Password for beta branch: passwordforbetabranch",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I'd be happy to hear your feedback!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Preferably on our discord here- https://discord.gg/rqBne5G",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Grab the \"Testing\" role from the #roles channel to gain access to the #testing channel",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
